# Every text file is LF on every OS. Markdown and YAML here are consumed by
# a cross-platform CLI (spec-kit reads preset/extension files verbatim and
# composes command wrappers), so the wrap placeholder and markdown must be
# byte-identical everywhere; the catch-all also covers extensionless files
# (LICENSE, .gitattributes, .gitignore). text=auto leaves binary files alone.
#
# The monorepo root carries the same catch-all. This copy is not redundant: it
# is what keeps this directory correct if it is ever extracted back into a
# repository of its own.
* text=auto eol=lf
